$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM S-4-(1,1,1-Trifluoro-2-hydroxypropan-2-yl)phenyl dimethylcarbamothioate
(13). A 2 L 3-neck flask under dry N2 atmosphere equipped with overhead
stirring was charged with 12 (100 g, 450 mmol) and THF (750 mL). The
suspension was stirred until solids were dissolved. To the solution was
added TMS-CF3 (99 mL, 670 mmol). The solution was brought to an internal
temperature of ˗5 °C. In one portion was added solid TBAF (0.88 g, 3.4
mmol). The temperature was adjusted to 3 °C at which point an exotherm
initiated at 0.2 °C/sec. The internal temperature was controlled at 6 °C
with the application of a salt-ice bath for a period of 15 min. The ice
bath was removed and over 20 min the internal temperature continued to
rise to 15 °C. TLC (1 % MeOH in CH2Cl2 ) confirmed consumption of
starting material. To the red-orange solution was added 5 M HCl (750 mL)
resulting in an increase in temperature to 40 °C. The solution was
stirred for 30 min. The organics were separated and the aqueous extracted
with ethyl acetate (4 x 300 mL). The combined organics were washed with
saturated sodium bicarbonate (300 mL) and brine (300 mL), dried over
MgSO4 , and removed in vacuo to provide 13. Yellow solid, yield 99%. 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3 ): δ 7.61 (d , J = 8 Hz, 2H), 7.54 (d, J = 9 Hz, 2H),
3.08 (br.s, 6H), 2.63 (s, 1H), 1.76 (s, 3H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, reactant also recovered in 5% yield, exothermic
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis, in Vitro Covalent Binding Evaluation, and Metabolism of
14C-Labeled Inhibitors of 11β-HSD1
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Sun, Daqing; Ye, Qiuping; Yan, Xuelei; Rew, Yosup; Fan, Peter; He, Xiao;
Jiang, Min; McMinn, Dustin L.; Monshouwer, Mario; Tu, Hua; Powers, Jay P.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM ACS Medicinal Chemistry Letters (2014), 5(11), 1245-1250

