$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Isolation of the intermediate product 3a.
(E)-Ethyl 3-(2-((1S)-1-(1,1-dimethylethylsulfinamido)-2,2,2trifluor
ethyl)phenyl)acrylate (3a). 3a CF3TMS (67 μl, 0.43 mmol) was added to a
mixture of the imine 2a (66 mg, 0.21 mmol) and TBAT (232 mg, 0.43 mmol)
in THF (2 ml) at -55°C. After 0.5h saturated NH4Cl solution was added at
lower temperature, and the reaction mixture was warmed to room
temperature. The quenched reaction mixture was extracted three times with
ether and the combined organic layers were dried over anhydrous Na2SO4.
Solvents were removed under reduced pressure and the crude mixture was
purified by flash chromatography on silica gel (3:1 n-hexane:ethyl
acetate). (E)-Ethyl
3-(2-((1S)-1-(1,1-dimethylethylsulfinamido)-2,2,2trifluor
ethyl)phenyl)acrylate (3a). white solid (75 mg, 94% yield). M.p.=
55-57°C. [α]25D = -161.2 (c 1.0, CHCl3). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.24
(s, 9H), 1.34 (t, J=7.2 Hz, 3H), 3.72 (brd, J=6.2 Hz, 1H), 4.28 (q, J=7.2
Hz, 2H), 5.19 (m, 1H), 6.34 (d, J=15.6 Hz, 1H), 7.40-7.56 (m, 4H), 8.03
(d, J=15.6 Hz, 1H). 19F NMR (282.4 MHz, CDCl3) δ-83.9 (d, JFF=7.7 Hz, 3F)
13C NMR (75.5 MHz, CDCl3) δ 14.1 (CH3), 22.1 (3CH3), 56.9 (q, 2JCF = 30.7
Hz, CH), 57.0 (C), 60.6 (CH2), 123.3 (CH), 124.4 (q, 1JCF = 282.2 Hz,
CF3), 127.3 (CH), 127.9 (CH), 129.8 (CH), 130.1 (CH), 132.3 (C), 134.6
(C), 140.4 (CH), 166.0 (C). HRMS (EI) calcd for C17H22F3NO3S [M+ +H]:
378.1351, found: 378.1349.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective (stage 1)
