$DATUM (1S,4S,6S
R)-6-Hydroxy-6-trifluoromethyl-2-(4'-methoxybenzyl)azabicyclo[2.2.1]heptan-3-one
(21a). To a solution of 16 (0.123 g, 0.5 mmol) in dry THF (4 mL) was
added TMSCF3 (0.107 mg, 0.75 mmol). Tetrabutylammonium fluoride (TBAF)
(1.0 M solution in THF, 50 μL, 0.05 mmol) was added dropwise. The
resulting mixture was stirred under nitrogen for 2 h and was concentrated
under vacuum. The residue was purified by column chromatography
(hexanes/EtOAc, 2:1 to 1:1), giving 21a (0.149 g, 94%) as a white solid.
1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.19 (2H, d, J = 8.4 Hz), 6.87 (2H, d, J = 8.4
Hz), 5.00 (1H, d, J = 14.8 Hz), 4.56 (1H, br.s), 4.04 (1H, d, J = 14.4
Hz), 3.81 (3H, s), 3.74 (1H, s), 2.87 (1H, s), 2.33 (1H, dd, J = 14.0 Hz,
3.6 Hz), 1.80-1.91 (3H, m). 19F NMR (376 MHz, CDCl3) δ -78.19 (3F, s). MS
m/z (EI, DCM): 316.1 (M + 1)+, 315.1 (M)+, 121.1 (CH3OC6H4CH2)+. HRMS
calcd for C15H16O3NF3: 315.1070. Found: 315.1077.
