$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM tert-Butyl 2-[3-(2,2,2-trifluoro-1-hydroxyethyl)-4-aminophenoxy]acetate :
To a stirred solution of aldehyde (9.3 g, 33.2 mmol) and carefully dried
cesium fluoride (cat.) in DME (66 mL) was added TMSCF3 (2.0 M in THF,
17.4 mL, 34.8 mmol) at 0 °C under argon atmosphere. After additional
stirring for 5 h at room temperature, acetone (60 mL) and 10% aqueous
NaHSO3 (60 mL) were added to the reaction mixture. After additional
stirring for 1h, the mixture was concentrated in vacuo, the residue was
extracted with EtOAc (60 mL), and purified by column chromatography
(EtOAc/hexane = 3/7) to afford tert-butyl
2-[3-(2,2,2-trifluoro-1-hydroxyethyl)-4-nitrophenoxy]acetate as a solid,
yield 10.8 g, 93 %. Rf = 0.22 (SiO2, EtOAc/hexane = 2:8); mp 96.3 °C; 1H
NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 8.08 (d, J = 9.3 Hz, 1H), 7.42 (s, 1H), 6.96 (dd,
J = 9.0 Hz and 2.8 Hz, 1H), 6.32 (q, J = 12 Hz, 1H) 4.61 (s, 1H) 3.81 (s,
1H) 1.50 (s, 9H); 1C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.8, 162.3, 142.5, 133.0,
128.4, 130.1, 126.4, 122.7, 118.9 (q, J = 280.0 Hz, -C*OHCF3), 115.9,
115.8, 84.4, 68.0, 67.5, 67.1, 66.7, (q, J = 30.0 Hz, -C*OHCF3), 66.3,
28.6; 19F (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ -1.60, -1.62 (plausibly due to H-bonded
cyclic conformers); HRMS (FAB) calcd. for C14H16F3NO6 (M + H) 352.1008,
found 352.1005
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
