Rh-Catalyzed Asymmetric Arylation of Aromatic Aldehydes
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Morikawa, Satoshi; Michigami, Kyosuke; Amii, Hideki
